                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Symbol shipped. The three items this row listed as pending are all done: brand-escala-1x.png exists at scale 1, all seven flows carry the mark, and the code change landed as CODE_CHANGES §11 (logos, favicons, the maskable icon, the manifest and the service worker's cache bust). 2026-10-14: Soft Candle shipped in #821 and the kit moved to 1.2.0 (Logo, LogoMark, TopBar, SidebarNav); the sheets for the disc were removed from this file; they live in git history before this change.",
